      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**File: Add** gives TRELLIS 2, the 3D node's default model, the image as `image_url`. TRELLIS 2 turns it into a textured 3D model at its quickest setting, `resolution` 512 in `arguments`. **Save 3D Model** saves it and shows it.\n\nIf you cancel while the request still waits in fal's queue, fal drops it and bills nothing. A request fal has already started may still finish and be billed. Collect it with **Request: Download** and **Save 3D Model**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
